tags":{"topics":["EPS/獲利","法說/展望","法人動向","AI/半導體","總經/聯準會","匯率","美股/國際"],"bull":["獲利","反彈"],"bear":[],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":["標普500","那斯達克100","高盛","AI","聯準會","Fed","升息預期","獲利前景"]},"time":"11/24 00:00"}],"fund":{"code":"1618","rev_month":"11510","rev":347489.0,"rev_mom":-0.7307590123611972,"rev_yoy":29.6997588814488,"rev_cum_yoy":2.1967974895138034,"eps_q":4.04,"eps_year":"115","eps_season":"3","net_income":778127.0,"pe":5.93,"pb":0.84,"yield":5.75,"updated":"2026-11-27 02:23"},"tdcc":{"latest":{"date":"2026-11-20","big1000":53.23,"big400":57.79,"retail":20.67,"holders":21528},"prev":{"date":"2026-11-13","big1000":53.14,"big400":57.63,"retail":20.81,"holders":21603},"d_big1000":0.09,"d_big400":0.16,"d_retail":-0.14,"d_holders":-75},"weekly":{"bars":[{"time":"2026-07-27","open":38.0,"high":38.8,"low":35.85,"close":38.1,"volume":3320.601},{"time":"2026-08-03","open":38.0,"high":39.45,"low":37.75,"close":38.45,"volume":2525.016},{"time":"2026-08-10","open":39.3,"high":42.2,"low":39.3,"close":41.7,"volume":7755.112999999999},{"time":"2026-08-17","open":40.1,"high":40.25,"low":38.1,"close":39.1,"volume":2973.83},{"time":"2026-08-24","open":39.1,"high":41.2,"low":38.7,"close":40.4,"volume":3265.998},{"time":"2026-08-31","open":40.6,"high":40.6,"low":39.4,"close":39.65,"volume":1692.8919999999998},{"time":"2026-09-07","open":39.95,"high":39.95,"low":38.7,"close":38.8,"volume":1465.7830000000001},{"time":"2026-09-14","open":38.8,"high":39.35,"low":38.45,"close":39.35,"volume":1202.158},{"time":"2026-09-21","open":39.55,"high":39.55,"low":38.5,"close":38.65,"volume":1013.2420000000001},{"time":"2026-09-29","open":38.8,"high":39.25,"low":38.3,"close":39.15,"volume":1094.973},{"time":"2026-10-05","open":39.45,"high":39.45,"low":38.0,"close":38.1,"volume":1883.204},{"time":"2026-10-12","open":38.3,"high":39.55,"low":38.25,"close":39.1,"volume":1668.695},{"time":"2026-10-19","open":38.65,"high":38.8,"low":37.8,"close":37.8,"volume":1313.443},{"time":"2026-10-27","